OL,3,GNEWSADriver 'unlikely' to have suffered
OL,4,Aseizure in fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA driver who had a history of seizures
OL,7,Fwas unlikely to have had a medical
OL,8,Fepisode when she killed a young father
OL,9,Fin a fatal crash, an inquest has heard.
OL,11,FNomazwe Moyo was jailed for 12 years in
OL,12,FJune after admitting causing the death
OL,13,Fof Muhammad Aftab Ahmad, 20, in the
OL,14,Fcollision on the A610 Bobbers Mill
OL,15,FBridge, in Alfreton Road, last October.
OL,17,FThe court heard Moyo had been involved
OL,18,Fin three previous crashes and was
OL,19,Fdiagnosed with "probable epilepsy", but
OL,20,Fdid not follow advice to stop driving
OL,21,For report her condition to the DVLA.
OL,23,APub: 20-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
