OL,3,GNEWSADriver 'unlikely' to have suffered
OL,4,Aseizure in fatal crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FOn Thursday, a coroner said while
OL,7,FNottinghamshire Police had no legal
OL,8,Fduty to refer drivers to the DVLA, she
OL,9,Fwelcomed a new policy to include such
OL,10,Freferrals in training.
